{"availability":"available","full":"SandObserver/Stackyard","name":"Stackyard","description":"A self-hosted homelab dashboard you actually want to look at. Calm, live activity badges from any API, single container, zero dependencies.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":5,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-09T18:47:51Z","updated":"2026-10-10T20:51:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stackyard.sandobserver.com","topics":["dashboard","docker","docker-compose","homelab","homelab-dashboard","homepage","pwa","zero-dependencies"],"demo":"https://demo.sandobserver.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.623Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.623Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.623Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.623Z","stars":5,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted homelab dashboard you actually want to look at.","Note: The first demo visit may take up to a minute due to Render's free-tier cold start.","Most dashboards are a wall of numbers and charts. Stackyard is the opposite: a calm, launcher-style grid of app tiles, folders, and a small number of genuinely useful widgets, running in a single container. Built to be glanced at a hundred times a day without feeling cluttered."],"features":["Attention goes where it's needed, not everywhere at once. A calm grid, no charts or counters. Health badges only appear when something's wrong.","A glance should tell you more than a number would. Widgets are small visuals, not readouts.","Anything can be a badge. Point Stackyard at any API and show what it reports as a live activity badge. One poll can carry several labelled values, each with its own colour and threshold. No custom widget, no code.","Configured by clicking, not by editing files. Everything is set up in the web UI, with config import and export.","No dependencies. Review it once and stop worrying about the supply chain."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SandObserver/Stackyard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"845400186abde5e1f6b8dffcdbd767315a0c005a56dd16291ad7d22db00a520d","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.800Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.800Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted homelab dashboard you actually want to look at.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SandObserver/Stackyard/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Weather: Open-Meteo (no API key required) or OpenWeather (free API key)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SandObserver/Stackyard/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"845400186abde5e1f6b8dffcdbd767315a0c005a56dd16291ad7d22db00a520d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SandObserver/Stackyard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.800Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T20:51:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SandObserver/Stackyard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.801Z","hash":"845400186abde5e1f6b8dffcdbd767315a0c005a56dd16291ad7d22db00a520d","originalBytes":7240,"storedBytes":7240,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["stackyard","widgets","api","docker","icons","license","one","widget","build","contributing","data","first","health","name","own","see","small","accessibility.md","admin","app","badges","calm","changelog.md","changes","code","config","container","covered","dashboard","dashboards","disk","docker-compose.yml","documentation","each","every","everything","free","ghcr.io","github","governance.md","grid","host","how","image","including","keep","key","must","notice","number","read","reports","running","sandobserver","security","services","set","unraid","welcome","what","about","access","accessibility","activity","actually","adding","adds","adguard","against","any","anything","apache","app.","appear","apps","assessed","at.","attention","attribution","audiobook